    "summary": "Battlewinner was an adult female NightWing who was introduced in The Dark Secret. Before the NightWing Exodus, she was the queen of the NightWings and was described in A NightWing Guide to the Dragons of Pyrrhia to be \"a closely guarded secret.\" She was the mother of Greatness and froze to death after leaving her lava cauldron in an attempt to attack Glory and Starflight.\n\n\n== Description ==\nBattlewinner had black scales that gleamed like polished ebony and seemed to emit white steam. Her eyes were dark with a glint of icy blue in their depths, and two of her teeth were also pale blue, appearing more like icicles than regular teeth. Her throat and black tongue were lined with pale blue frost, in patterns that glinted and swirled and were feathery or sharp. She had heavy shoulders, a thickset neck, a battle-scarred snout, glistening claws, and a thick head. She was massive, as big as Morrowseer, and had a creaky, quiet, rough, and eerie voice, like claws scraping on ice several caves away, as well as a barking laugh. Whenever she emerged from her cauldron, she glowed horribly, with lava dripping between her scales and claws.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nBattlewinner could be considered cunning and...",
