    "name": "Bloodworm",
    "pageid": 70,
    "summary": "Bloodworm is an adult female HiveWing who was mentioned in The Hive Queen. She is a sister of Ex-Queen Wasp, and was the ruler of Bloodworm Hive before it was burned down by the PoisonWings and the Chrysalis. She is currently imprisoned in the flamesilk factory alongside her other sisters.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nAccording to Grayling, she is one of Wasp's cruelest sisters.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hive Queen ====\nBloodworm was indirectly mentioned when Scarab talked to Cricket about Wasp's mind control, and how it did not work on herself or any of Wasp's sisters.\n\n\n==== The Poison Jungle ====\nIn the prologue, Bryony described her Hive as \"palpably horrible,\" and Grayling stated that Bloodworm Hive has a lot of Chrysalis members due to how cruel she is.\n\n\n==== The Flames of Hope ====\nBloodworm was mentioned to have had construction projects and strict rules about them. She ordered that at least one dragon per household must contribute to the projects, hence the reason why Dusky was in construction at a young age. \nBloodworm was indirectly mentioned when Luna said that Wasp and the rest of her sisters had been imprisoned in the flamesilk caverns.\n\n\n=== Field Guides ===\n\n��4�...",
