    "name": "Bombardier",
    "pageid": 77,
    "summary": "Bombardier is a male HiveWing dragonet who was introduced in The Lost Continent. He currently attends Terrarium Academy.\n\n\n== Description ==\nBombardier has jet-black scales and flecks of red along his ears, wings, and claws.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nCricket describes Bombardier to be intensely arrogant, awful, smug, stupid and immensely annoying, and that \"there is not much difference between him and brain-dead him.\" According to Cricket, Bombardier believes that she is in love with him, although she openly says she is not. Because of this, he constantly tries to 'let her down gently.' She describes Bombardier as uninteresting and the complete opposite of Blue.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n== Quotes ==\n\n\n== Gallery ==\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n== References ==",
