    "name": "Boto",
    "pageid": 83,
    "summary": "Boto is a male RainWing dragonet who was introduced in Moon Rising. He is currently attending Jade Mountain Academy as a member of the Silver Winglet.\n\n\n== Description ==\nBoto is placid-looking.  \n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Jade Mountain Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== Moon Rising ====\nHe was described to be dancing with both Sepia and Kinkajou when the Jade and Silver Winglets used the instruments together in the music room at Jade Mountain Academy. Later on, he was resting in a patch of sunlight along with two other RainWing students, Coconut and Siamang.\n\n\n==== Darkness of Dragons ====\nQibli saw Boto attending history class along with the Jade, Gold, and Silver Winglets. When Darkstalker's murderous past was brought up, Boto's talons turned lime green, and he began anxiously asking whether it was likely that they would be murdered.\n\n\n== Quotes ==\n\n\n== Gallery ==\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\tArt by Mike Holmes, from the Wings of Fire Graphic Novels\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n== References ==",
