    "name": "Bullfrog (TDG)",
    "pageid": 94,
    "summary": "(Not to be confused with Bullfrog, the RainWing medic who appeared in Winter Turning.)\n\nBullfrog is a male MudWing who was introduced in The Dangerous Gift. He was formerly a member of the stealth team and accompanied them to Pantala in order to fulfill The Lost Continent Prophecy. He was formerly under the control of the othermind and currently resides in the Mud Kingdom.\n\n\n== Description ==\nBullfrog is brawny, strong-looking, and nearly twice the size of the other dragons going on the journey to Pantala. He has massive legs, big talons, brown scales, thick wings, and a deep voice. He is about the same size as Pokeweed. \n\n\n== Personality ==\nBullfrog rarely says anything, and when he does say something, his speech is often short. Luna thought that if he had a personality, or any sort of passion for anything, it was buried as deeply as a fossil. When Qibli attempted to joke with him, he was confused, ponderous, and puzzled, and he took Qibli's jokes quite seriously. He is self-satisfied, placid, implacable, stealthy, and often mumbles and speaks slowly on the occasions he does talk.\nHe also grunts and pauses for long moments of time between thoughts, as he seemed stumped when Cricket asked...",
