    "name": "Bumblebee",
    "pageid": 96,
    "summary": "Bumblebee is a female HiveWing dragonet who was introduced in The Hive Queen. Since her egg was only injected once with the breath of evil, she was immune to the othermind's mind control. She currently resides in the LeafSilk Kingdom.\n\n\n== Description ==\nBumblebee has black scales that are striped with wide, fuzzy swathes of bright yellow and yellow-and-black-striped wings. She has patches of black scales circling her yellow-gold eyes, making her look like a tragic panda. She has a rather round face, as well as a very loud, high-pitched voice. She is small, roughly the size of a large mango. She has big, black-rimmed, woebegone eyes in a warm golden face, as well as thin, shimmering wings.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nBumblebee is fierce, loud, squirmy, grumpy, sassy, and her face typically bears an outraged expression. She often turns into a shrieking hurricane of fury when it is time for bed. After hearing Swordtail state that some dragons can be stupid, Bumblebee avidly agreed, shouting her opinion loudly enough that several dragons flying overhead turned to see what the noise was. She then proceeded to shout insults at several surrounding grasshoppers.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent... ===",
