    "name": "Cardinal (EP)",
    "pageid": 109,
    "summary": "(This is the page for Cardinal, a young SkyWing introduced in Escaping Peril. You may be looking for the human named Cardinal instead.)\n\nCardinal is a male SkyWing dragonet who was introduced in Escaping Peril. He currently resides in the SkyWing wingery.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nCardinal was said to drool when he sleeps by one of the dragonets within the SkyWing dragonet wingery. When this comment was made, Cardinal was most likely the one who exclaimed \"shut up!\"\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Jade Mountain Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== Escaping Peril ====\nWhen Peril, Scarlet, and Soar visited the wingery to capture Prince Cliff, he and the other dragonets were discussing how Scarlet's disfigured face looked, and it was mentioned that her face supposedly looked even grosser than when Cardinal drooled in his sleep. He responded by telling the others to shut up.\n\n\n== References ==",
