    "summary": "Cerulean is a male SeaWing dragonet prince who was introduced in the prologue of Talons of Power.  He is one of the thirty-two sons of Queen Coral and King Gill and the hatchmate of Turtle and Octopus. He currently resides in the Deep Palace with his brothers.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n=== The Jade Mountain Prophecy ===\n\n\n=== Field Guides ===\n\n\n== Family tree ==\n\n\n== Quotes ==\n\n\n== Trivia ==\nCerulean and Octopus were at the Talons of Power ceremony with Turtle, even though they should have been there two years prior — the year Turtle missed the ceremony due to being sick.\n\n\n== Gallery ==\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\tArt by Mike Holmes, from the Wings of Fire Graphic Novels\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n== References ==",
