    "name": "Cinnabar (EP)",
    "pageid": 136,
    "summary": "(Not to be confused with Cinnabar, a SilkWing from The Hive Queen.)\n\nCinnabar is a male SkyWing guard who was introduced in Escaping Peril.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Jade Mountain Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== Escaping Peril ====\nWhile Queen Ruby was at Jade Mountain Academy to collect Carnelian's body, Cinnabar did not believe Clay, Tsunami, and Sunny that Carnelian was killed by a MudWing. He argued that Peril must have been involved in Carnelian's death. He later chased after Scarlet by Ruby's command after she threatened the academy.\n\n\n== Relationships ==\n\n\n=== Peril ===\nAlthough Peril does not know Cinnabar, he strongly despises her. He believes that Peril was involved in Carnelian's death, even when Ruby does not.\n\n\n== Quotes ==\n\n\n== Trivia ==\nIn the novel, Cinnabar was unnamed. He was only named in the graphic novel.\n\n\n== Gallery ==\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\tArt by Mike Holmes, from the Wings of Fire Graphic Novels\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n== References ==",
