    "name": "Cinnabar (THQ)",
    "pageid": 137,
    "summary": "(Not to be confused with Cinnabar, a SkyWing from Escaping Peril.)\n\nCinnabar is a female SilkWing who was introduced in The Hive Queen. She was a member of the Jewel Hive Chrysalis and worked as a cook for Lady Jewel. She and Io attempted to help the SilkWings that were not under the control of the othermind, but they were captured before being freed when Luna destroyed the consciousness of the othermind. \n\n\n== Description ==\nCinnabar has burnt, dark orange scales with glints of dark red under her wings and along her spine, making her look almost like a HiveWing. She has dark orange claws and is rather small.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nCinnabar is kind, outspoken, and sympathetic. She believes that HiveWings could be good; however, she is disapproving of Tau and Treehopper's relationship.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hive Queen ====\nCinnabar was part of the Jewel Hive Chrysalis and first appeared when Cricket, Blue, Sundew, and Swordtail hid in the Jewel Hive library. When Queen Wasp arrived through a mind controlled HiveWing soldier, she eventually exposed herself along with Tau and apologizing for sneaking out to read in the library to cover. When Wasp persisted that...",
