    "name": "Clay",
    "pageid": 140,
    "summary": "Clay is an adult male MudWing and the main protagonist of The Dragonet Prophecy. Formerly a dragonet of destiny, he was also partially responsible for ending the War of SandWing Succession and is one of the five founders of Jade Mountain Academy, where he currently resides. There, he teaches Herbs and Healing, helps with battle training, and runs the prey center.    \n\n\n== Description ==\nClay is muscular, large, burly, and stocky, with a sloping back, a thick, lengthy neck, a large, broad head, and white teeth. He is the largest of the dragonets of destiny, and has a rumbly, deep, warm voice. He also has fire-resistant, mud-colored scales. Clay's scales are a warm brown in the shades of rich mahogany and tree bark, along with undertones of glowing amber, clay, and gold glinting between and beneath his scales.  \nHe has enormous feet and thick brown claws, as well as mud-colored, massive, strong brown wings and wide, warm brown eyes. His right thigh is scarred from a dragonbite viper laceration, which resulted in a permanent limp.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nClay is thoughtful, accidentally heroic, and sounds kind no matter who he talks to. He is earnest, goofy, loyal, sweet, agreeable, easily confused...",
