    "name": "Clearpool",
    "pageid": 141,
    "summary": "Clearpool was a female SeaWing dragonet princess who was introduced in Darkstalker. She resided on an island off the coast of the Rainforest Kingdom and was one of the three dragonets of Fathom and Indigo, along with Ripple and Cowrie.\n\n\n== Description ==\nClearpool was small, with green scales.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nClearpool was named after Clearsight, but Fathom and Indigo reflected that they may have named the wrong dragonet after Clearsight's calm and thoughtful personality, given Clearpool's rowdy energy. She was compared to Indigo's younger self, who had a few shrieking fits at that age.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== Legends ===\n\n\n==== Darkstalker ====\nIn the epilogue, Clearpool attempted and failed to catch a fish in a nearby lake. Clearpool accidentally kicked sand at Cowrie which caused a fight between them. Ripple joined the fight and jumped on top of them, followed by Blob. To get the dragonets to calm down, Indigo offered to tell them a story. Clearpool was excited to hear a story and requested one about the Kingdom of the Sea but ended up listening to a story about evil dragons at Cowrie's request.\n\n\n== Family tree ==\n\n\n== Quotes ==\n\n\n== Trivia ==\nClearpool was named after Clearsight.\n\n\n== Gallery... ==",
