    "name": "Clearsight",
    "pageid": 142,
    "summary": "Clearsight was an adult female NightWing who was introduced in Darkstalker as one of the three main protagonists. Under one full moon, she was hatched with exceptionally powerful foresight and formerly served as Queen Vigilance's head seer for a short amount of time while she resided in the Night Kingdom.\nAfter imprisoning Darkstalker under Agate Mountain in order to save Pyrrhia, Clearsight relocated to Pantala to avoid her urges to free him. There she partnered with multiple BeetleWings, her first partner being Sunstreak. Over time, her descendants diverged into the HiveWings, and the BeetleWings who were not descended from Clearsight became the SilkWing tribe.\nBefore her death, she used her precognitive abilities to create the Book of Clearsight. In the modern era, most dragons whom inhabit Pantala worship and pray to Clearsight, seeing her as a divine being of guidance and wisdom.\n\n\n== Description ==\nClearsight had large dark purple eyes, black scales, and black wings. She was beautiful and sleek.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nDeeply kind, willful, serious, and often worried and harried, Clearsight was often known to be the voice of reason towards both Darkstalker and Fathom. She was selfless...",
