    "name": "Cliff",
    "pageid": 144,
    "summary": "Cliff is a male SkyWing dragonet prince and one of the three main protagonists of Hero. He currently resides in the SkyWing palace with his father Jasper. He is well-known throughout the Sky Kingdom for his singing and songwriting.\n\n\n== Description ==\nCliff has dark red scales and a long neck. He is small and has tiny talons, as well as giant, golden-orange eyes that are almost the color of a goldfish.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nWhen Scarlet suggested that Cliff was ordinary, he puffed out his chest and denied it; he later stated that Scarlet was mean for saying so, and seemed baffled when Peril said that being ordinary seemed great to her. He sang softly to himself while under the care of Peril, and asked her if she wanted to hear a song that he had made up just then. He also later sang himself to sleep. He is indignant, unafraid, clever, proud, hopeful, cheeky, theatrical, and skilled at rhyming. According to Cliff, everyone says that he is special, and he believes that he is going to be the best singer in Pyrrhia one day, as well as friends with every dragon. Despite being threatened by Scarlet, Cliff tried his best to sit up and look brave. He later complained about there being nothing to...",
