    "name": "Clorinde",
    "pageid": 145,
    "summary": "Clorinde is an adult female SilkWing who was mentioned in The Flames of Hope. She formerly taught art at Silkworm Hall.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nSwordtail described Clorinde as \"great.\" She is an excellent tapestry weaver, having made beautiful artworks within the school.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Flames of Hope ====\nClorinde was mentioned in Luna's memory of when she first met Swordtail. Luna noticed a beautiful tapestry on the wall of the art classroom, and Swordtail mentioned that it was made by her. He said that she was great and joked that if someone told the HiveWings about that, they would take her away because the SilkWing dragonets were not allowed to have fun or have any joy.\n\n\n== References ==",
