    "name": "Clubtail",
    "pageid": 146,
    "summary": "Clubtail is an adult male SilkWing who was introduced in The Lost Continent. He is one of the ten flamesilk SilkWings who were imprisoned by Ex-Queen Wasp and was last seen enslaved in the flamesilk factory. Like Admiral, he was sent out once to have eggs in the hope of having more flamesilks, but none of his dragonets were flamesilks.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nAccording to Danaid, he is nice but never stops talking. Admiral described him as selfish and ignorant.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Lost Continent ====\nWhile meeting Blue for the first time, Admiral explained to his son that he feels so lucky to have two flamesilk dragonets, as none of Clubtail's dragonets inherited the ability.\nWhen Danaid listed all the flamesilks in the flamesilk factory to Blue, she mentioned Clubtail.\nAdmiral mentioned him when he told Blue that he would never work with dragons like Clubtail, Danaid, or Whitespeck.\n\n\n== References ==",
