    "name": "Cobra",
    "pageid": 147,
    "summary": "Cobra is an adult female SandWing who was introduced in Darkness of Dragons. She is the mother of Qibli, Rattlesnake, and Sirocco and daughter of Vulture. Before being imprisoned by Queen Thorn at the SandWing stronghold, Cobra's skills were legendary among certain circles, and she outshone all of the assassins in the Scorpion Den.\n\n\n== Description ==\nCobra has snakelike patterns down her spine. She looks beautiful and deadly, with a dangerous glitter in her eyes. She is long, large, and thin, and has a toothy smile.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nCobra is dishonest, untrustworthy, greedy, cold, deadly, smart, nefarious, evil, scornful, and hates dragonets. She has a fierce hostility towards other tribes and is very strict about grammar. Her voice sounded bored when she was imprisoned within the SandWing stronghold.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n=== The Jade Mountain Prophecy ===\n\n\n== Relationships ==\n\n\n=== Qibli ===\nCobra is dishonest and scornful towards her son, and did not care at all what he did or how he was affected. Cobra considers him a half-witted idiot with crazy ideas, completely ordinary and useless, and doubts his ability to ever do anything important. Later on in life, she snapped...",
