    "name": "Cobra Lily",
    "pageid": 148,
    "summary": "Cobra Lily is a female LeafWing who was introduced in The Poison Jungle. Formerly a member of the PoisonWings, she served as a guard in the PoisonWing village. Her last known whereabouts were in Sanctuary after moving to Pyrrhia with the other Pantalan refugees to escape the othermind.\n\n\n== Description ==\nCobra Lily has green scales that are tinted pink, with streaks of pinkish-red along her horns and the veins of her summer-green wings. She is long and elegant.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nCobra Lily is described as the opposite of Nettle, and is never annoying or judgmental. She rarely shows her anger, preferring to hold icy grudges for years and can be quite brutal. Only close friends like Sundew know about those grudges. Cobra Lily is also willing to leap into action immediately. Sundew notes that she was always the top of the class. Cobra Lily was content with staying on Pyrrhia and showed little concern about the othermind-infected dragons back on Pantala. Unlike many PoisonWings, Cobra Lily does not seem to be overly hostile towards HiveWings, at least to the point when she did not seem to want to kill Cricket when she first saw her.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n��4...",
