    "name": "Cochineal",
    "pageid": 149,
    "summary": "Cochineal was an elderly female HiveWing who was mentioned in The Hive Queen. She was Scarab's sister and the mother of Ex-Queen Wasp and her seven sisters. She ruled as queen of the HiveWings before Wasp took the throne.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nCochineal was described by Hawthorn as deceitful and power-hungry, while Lady Scarab stated that she was an expert liar. However, Cochineal was not as bad as Wasp, or in Lady Scarab's exact words, \"was [not] any picnic as a ruler, but at least she wasn't a dictatorial zombie-making maniac.\" Lady Scarab stated to her niece that Cochineal would have hated to see what Wasp had done to the HiveWings and would have disapproved, if not hated, her daughter's tyranny, which suggests she greatly loved and cared about her tribe.\nCochineal was also said to have respected the other tribes' monarchies, meaning she also was most likely fine with just ruling only one tribe and was not power-hungry enough to go to war for more power. This also may mean she had a good relationship with her sister and had been trusted by her mother to take the throne from her.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hive Queen ====\nLady Scarab mentioned Cochineal in...",
