    "name": "Coconut",
    "pageid": 150,
    "summary": "Coconut is a male RainWing dragonet who was introduced in The Hidden Kingdom. He currently attends Jade Mountain Academy as a member of the Copper Winglet and is clawmates with Marsh.\n\n\n== Description ==\nCoconut is small. He typically has sleepy eyes and quiet lavender-blue scales.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nHe demonstrates stereotypical RainWing traits such as laziness and carelessness. Qibli referred to him as \"a sloth masquerading as a dragon\" and \"the slowest, least threatening dragon in the world.\" He is often focused on food and not much else. Moonwatcher described his thoughts as \"slow and meaningless,\" and thought that she might go mad if she had to listen to his mind all day long. She compared his mind to Pyrite's, saying that it was shallow and not much deeper than hers. He is also ignorant.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hidden Kingdom ====\nCoconut was first introduced after Kinkajou and Glory returned from the prisons in the NightWing volcano. The duo flew over to the rainforest with Kinkajou, who was excited to be back, and Coconut was surprised to see the young RainWing. He did not seem to realize or have particularly cared that Kinkajou had been missing for several...",
