    "name": "Copperhead",
    "pageid": 154,
    "summary": "Copperhead was an adult male MudWing prince who was featured in A Guide to the Dragon World. He was the son of Queen Anhinga and the brother of Egret, Bayou, Sawgrass, and Possum. He resided in the MudWing palace before falling in love and running away to live in the rainforest with an unnamed RainWing.\n\n\n== Description ==\nCopperhead was the smallest of his siblings.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nSawgrass described Copperhead as sharp and quick. Copperhead claimed that he never wanted dragonets. He was clever.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== Pre-Series ===\nCopperhead hatched in the MudWing palace with his siblings where they were raised as royals. When Egret was getting her queen portrait done, Copperhead was present and noted to Sawgrass that he could have dragonets.\nDuring Egret's reign as queen, Copperhead fell in love with a RainWing and ran away with him to the rainforest.\n\n\n=== Field Guides ===\n\n\n==== A Guide to the Dragon World ====\nCopperhead was mentioned in Sawgrass's But Who Shall Wear the Crown?\n\n\n== Relationships ==\n\n\n=== Partner ===\nCopperhead loved his partner enough to run away to the Rainforest Kingdom with him, betraying his siblings.\n\n\n== Family tree ==\n\n    = Adopted\n\n\n== Quotes ==\n\n\n== References ==",
    "categories": [
      ""
    ],
    "url": "https://mirror.wingsoffire.wiki/wiki/Copperhead"
