    "name": "Coral",
    "pageid": 155,
    "summary": "Coral is an adult female SeaWing who was introduced in The Lost Heir. She is the current queen of the SeaWings and is renowned in the Kingdom of the Sea for writing countless scrolls. She was formerly married to King Gill and currently resides in the Deep Palace with her youngest daughter, Auklet. She was formerly allied with Blister during the War of SandWing Succession.\n\n\n== Description ==\nCoral is majestic, beautiful, and huge, with blue scales that are nearly identical to the color of Tsunami's. She has enormous blue wings with royal patterns of webbed talon prints underneath them. She smells like sea air and starfish. She has sharp white teeth and a forked tongue. Her eyes are a warm green color, and her neck, chest, and wings are adorned with strands of pearls. She also has a twisted white narwhal horn spear attached to the tip of her tail, black ink-stained claws, and a rumbly voice.  Additionally, Coral wears a thin, webbed harness with a long cord that first tied her to her daughter Anemone. Later on, she uses it to tie Auklet to herself.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nCoral is vengeful, over-protective, menacing, commanding, and stern. She is also ignorant, fearsome, judgemental, distrustful...",
