    "name": "Coypu",
    "pageid": 161,
    "summary": "Coypu was an adult female MudWing who was featured in A Guide to the Dragon World. She ruled as queen of the MudWings after her mother, Queen Olive, and was the adopted daughter of Prince Sawgrass. Before her death, she resided in the MudWing palace.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nSawgrass described Coypu as a great queen.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== Pre-Series ===\nCoypu and five other eggs were the dragonets of Olive. Olive offered Sawgrass her eggs for the throne in order to help with the MudWing Succession Crisis. When Coypu hatched, she became queen after her mother.\n\n\n=== Field Guides ===\n\n\n==== A Guide to the Dragon World ====\nCoypu was featured in the MudWing chapter of the guide where she was mentioned in Sawgrass's But Who Shall Wear the Crown?\n\n\n== Family tree ==\n\n    = Adopted\n\n\n== References ==",
