    "name": "Crane (TDP)",
    "pageid": 165,
    "summary": "(Not to be confused with Crane, the MudWing queen who lived about 2,000 years ago during the time period of Darkstalker.)\n\nCrane was a female MudWing dragonet who was mentioned in The Dragonet Prophecy. She was one of Clay's siblings and a soldier in Queen Moorhen's army until she was killed by Icicle during a battle between the IceWings and the MudWings while protecting her siblings during the War of SandWing Succession.\n\n\n== Description ==\nCrane was little, brown, and thin.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nCrane was shown to be selfless and protective in battle. She loved meeting new dragons.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n=== The Jade Mountain Prophecy ===\n\n\n=== The Forgotten Isles Prophecy ===\n\n\n== Family tree ==\n\n\n== Quotes ==\n\n\n== Trivia ==\nCrane had a habit of saving caterpillars and would protect them until they became butterflies.\nCrane loved meeting new dragons and dancing at MudWing festivals.\n\n\n== Gallery ==\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\tArt by Mike Holmes, from the Wings of Fire Graphic Novels\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n== References ==",
