    "name": "Crocodile",
    "pageid": 167,
    "summary": "Crocodile was an adult female MudWing who was introduced in The Lost Heir. Originally thought to be a member of the Talons of Peace, she secretly served Burn as a spy and revealed the location of the Summer Palace to the SkyWings during the War of SandWing Succession. She was presumably killed by Glory's venom during the bombing of the Summer Palace after threatening to hand over the dragonets of destiny to the SkyWings.\n\n\n== Description ==\nCrocodile was large with brown scales and wings. She had a horrible scar pulling down one corner of her mouth into a strange grimace.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nBefore she revealed herself as a scheming infiltrator, Webs considered her to be sympathetic.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Lost Heir ====\nCrocodile was one of the newest members of the Talons of Peace, who confronted Webs about the missing dragonets. She saved him from being mauled by Cirrus by fighting him, as well as other Talons of Peace members to gain his trust. Once Webs was safe, Crocodile suggested that he should go back to the Kingdom of the Sea, where Queen Coral would presumably forgive him, and how it may be the only way for him to be safe.\nShe later appeared at Queen...",
