    "summary": "Crescent is a female NightWing-SilkWing hybrid who was introduced in The Hybrid Prince. She was formerly exiled with the Triumvirate before they overthrew Beryl and Snakeroot. She currently resides in the Court of Refuge.\n\n\n== Description ==\nCrescent has deep blue-black scales except for two silver teardrops by her eyes. She has butterfly wings dotted with silver crescents like little moons. Otherwise, she mostly resembles a NightWing.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nCrescent is very blunt. According to Platypus, Crescent does not believe in secrets. When talking about other dragons' thoughts, she sounds bored, impassive, and cool.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Forgotten Isles Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hybrid Prince ====\nCrescent was introduced to Umber when Platypus brought him to meet the exiles at their meeting place, who tried to take him hostage. When Umber thought about how Mulberry would be a good hostage, Crescent told the others that that was what he thought, revealing herself to be a mind reader. Crescent was skeptical about whether Umber would help them, believing that he was a dragon who followed orders.\nWhen Platypus, Quokka, and Umber went to deliver food to the exiled dragons, Crescent asked Umber not...",
