    "name": "Dazzling",
    "pageid": 185,
    "summary": "Dazzling is an adult female RainWing who was introduced in The Hidden Kingdom. She was one of the six RainWing queens that shared the RainWing throne before Glory became queen. She currently resides in the RainWing village.  Dazzling was listed as the current queen in A NightWing Guide to the Dragons of Pyrrhia before Starflight updated it.\n\n\n== Description ==\nDazzling is a quite large and portly RainWing.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nDazzling, as described by Kinkajou, was a queen who would grant anybody's petition as long as they gave her enough tribute. She appeared to be gluttonous and confident.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hidden Kingdom ====\nWhen Starflight requested an audience with Queen Dazzling, both Jambu and Liana looked confused by his request and asked him if he meant it. Jambu then asked Liana if this month was Dazzling's turn as queen, revealing that the RainWings take turns being queen one month at a time, much to the shock and displeasure of Glory and the other dragonets.\nDazzling participated in the fruit‐gathering contest against Mangrove during the challenge for the RainWing throne. It was revealed when the fruit was counted that Dazzling had eaten three...",
