    "name": "Deathbringer",
    "pageid": 187,
    "summary": "Deathbringer is an adult male NightWing and the main protagonist of Assassin. As an apprentice under his mother, Quickstrike, he formerly served as an assassin for the NightWings. He has since relocated to the Rainforest Kingdom and is currently in a relationship with Glory. \n\n\n== Description ==\nDeathbringer has black scales, eyes, and wings with a glittering spray of scattered, sparkling, silver scales underneath that catch the morning light like trapped stars. He is a lot younger and smaller than Morrowseer, and only a bit larger than Starflight. He is strong and astonishingly fast. He has a rakish, cheeky grin, and is wiry and graceful in his movements, even when he is startled. He is heavier than Winter and has clearly been trained to fight based on the way he stands and assesses others. \n\n\n== Personality ==\nAs a young dragonet, Deathbringer followed orders without asking questions, even when he was tasked to kill a MudWing prisoner; he killed him as cleanly and quickly as possible. He is thoughtful, impatient, intelligent, charming, and trustworthy, and he was determined to follow orders. He can keep his emotions under control, he does not typically worry, and he is confident and talented...",
