    "name": "Diadem",
    "pageid": 192,
    "summary": "Diadem was an adult female SilkWing who was featured in A Guide to the Dragon World. She ruled as queen of the SilkWings before her daughter, Queen Monarch succeeded her.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nDiadem loved tales from the Book of Clearsight. She was impressed by the list of HiveWing queens due to the fact it saved bickering between HiveWing royal siblings. She loved telling stories and Monarch hinted that she was an excellent storyteller. \n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== Pre-Series ===\nQueen Diadem was the queen of the SilkWings before Monarch. She would tell her daughter stories about the Book of Clearsight. Diadem chose Monarch to be queen of the SilkWings after her reign.\n\n\n=== Field Guides ===\n\n\n==== A Guide to the Dragon World ====\nDiadem was mentioned several times by Monarch in the queen's final writing in the SilkWing chapter of the guide.\n\n\n== Relationships ==\n\n\n=== Monarch ===\nDiadem named her daughter after the two greatest queens of SilkWing history. Monarch hoped that was because Diadem knew Monarch would be a good queen the moment she hatched. Diadem told Monarch stories about the Book of Clearsight. \n\n\n== Family tree ==\n\n\n== References ==",
