    "summary": "Diamond was an adult female IceWing animus who was introduced in Darkstalker. She ruled as queen of the IceWing tribe during the era of Darkstalker. She heavily influenced the causation of the NightWing-IceWing War with her hatred towards Prince Arctic and Foeslayer's relationship.\nShe was one of the two known IceWings in Pyrrhian history to use their animus magic more than once, the other being her son, Arctic. After capturing Foeslayer, Diamond imprisoned her within the Ice Kingdom by enchanting two frozen shackles and several spears, ultimately creating the Diamond Trial, or the gift of vengeance.\n\n\n== Description ==\nDiamond wore ice-blue diamonds on her ears, neck, and tail band. She had sharp, glittering eyes and a superior, condescending tone of voice.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nDiamond was ruthless, cunning, vengeful, insane, judgmental, and placed heavy value upon noble IceWing traditions, but was willing to make exceptions for her own personal feelings, shown when she used magic more than once to capture Foeslayer. She was unpredictable and changed her mind often.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Jade Mountain Prophecy ===\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n=== Legends ===\n\n\n=== Winglets ===\n\n\n=== Field... ===",
