    "name": "Droplet",
    "pageid": 232,
    "summary": "Droplet is a SeaWing of unknown gender who was mentioned in Talons of Power. They are from a story written by Queen Coral.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Jade Mountain Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== Talons of Power ====\nTurtle briefly recalled Droplet's tale when he thought back to the stories he loved in his dragonethood and stated that his mother, Coral, wrote it. Droplet was an unimportant gardener who had learned of a MudWing invasion on the Kingdom of the Sea, so the SeaWings fought and stopped the MudWings before they found the kingdom's hidden palaces.",
