    "summary": "Fearless is a female NightWing dragonet who was introduced in Moon Rising. She is currently attending Jade Mountain Academy as a member of the Silver Winglet and a clawmate of Sepia. She owns a bracelet enchanted by Darkstalker that gifts the wearer with super-strength.\n\n\n== Description ==\nFearless has black scales and is rather small. She had worn a pair of bracelets made out of twisted black and silver wires that were enchanted by Darkstalker.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Jade Mountain Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== Moon Rising ====\nFearless was one of Moonwatcher's guesses on who the voice in her head could be. Later, Moonwatcher thought of her as someone who she could potentially ask about Darkstalker.\n\n\n==== Talons of Power ====\nUpon seeing Darkstalker when he first arrived at the academy, Fearless, Mightyclaws, and Mindreader all attempted to attack him. She was then later introduced to Darkstalker by Moonwatcher, and Fearless asked him questions about the lost city of night. After Darkstalker revealed Moonwatcher's prophetic and mind-reading abilities, she asked a barrage of questions. Darkstalker mentioned he could enchant objects, and Fearless quickly ran to get a bracelet with strands of twisted wire. She...",
