    "name": "Festoon",
    "pageid": 270,
    "summary": "Festoon was an adult male SilkWing who was mentioned in The Lost Continent. He was one of the ten flamesilk dragons who were imprisoned by Ex-Queen Wasp in the flamesilk factory until he passed away due to unknown causes.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Lost Continent ====\nWhile talking to Blue in the flamesilk cavern, Danaid and Pierid started a heated discussion about privacy, which was difficult to maintain in the small cave. During their argument, Pierid started talking about something that happened a few years ago, and he mentioned that it was not his fault Festoon had overheard his conversation with Heliconian about stealing radishes. Danaid retorted, stating that Festoon had died five years ago and that she would have been mad at Pierid instead.",
