    "name": "Fierceclaws",
    "pageid": 271,
    "summary": "Fierceclaws was a female NightWing-IceWing hybrid who was mentioned in Darkstalker. She was one of the six possible dragonets that Clearsight and Darkstalker might have had in a formerly possible future, and also the older sister of Eclipse, Shadowhunter, and three other unnamed dragonets.\nFierceclaws never existed in the timeline the books took place in.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Jade Mountain Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== Moon Rising ====\nFierceclaws was indirectly mentioned when Darkstalker said that he and Clearsight would have had six dragonets.\n\n\n==== Talons of Power ====\nFierceclaws was indirectly mentioned when Darkstalker stated that he never had dragonets, but he was meant to.\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Lost Continent ====\nIn the prologue, Clearsight mentioned Fierceclaws indirectly in her thoughts when she thought that she would always miss the dragonets that she would have had with Darkstalker.\n\n\n=== Legends ===\n\n\n==== Darkstalker ====\nWhen Darkstalker gave Clearsight the mind reader-blocking bracelet, she said to him that Eclipse would need it most. This led to their first conversation about their dragonets. Darkstalker listed their three future dragonets: Eclipse, Shadowhunter, and Fierceclaws...",
