    "summary": "Firefly is a female RainWing-NightWing hybrid dragonet who was introduced in one of Moonwatcher's visions near the end of Moon Rising. She is a possible future daughter of Deathbringer and Glory.\n\n\n== Description ==\nFirefly has dark purple scales. \n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Jade Mountain Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== Moon Rising ====\nFirefly was introduced in Moonwatcher's vision of a possible future, provided by Darkstalker. She was seen curled up in the library of Jade Mountain Academy, reading a scroll and discussing how the tribes used to hate each other, with two other dragons, one blue and one deep orange-brown.\n\n\n== Family tree ==\n\n    = Possible timeline\n\n\n== Gallery ==\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\tArt by Mike Holmes, from the Wings of Fire Graphic Novels\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n== References ==",
