    "summary": "Euphoria was a female BeetleWing who is introduced in The Hybrid Prince. She was formerly queen of the BeetleWings and was planning to merge her tribe with the LeafWings alongside her partner, Queen Magnolia, before they were discovered by Bloodshed.\n\n\n== Description ==\nEuphoria had teal scales and iridescent teal wings. The shape of her face and her eyes are similar to Platypus's.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Forgotten Isles Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hybrid Prince ====\nEuphoria was mentioned in the prologue by Sorrel, who wondered if Bloodshed and Precipice knew what Euphoria and Magnolia were planning if they had discovered Harmony.\nWhile viewing a scene in the Memory Room, Umber, Platypus, and Quokka saw Euphoria and Magnolia talking with each other about merging their tribes. The two were interrupted by Sorrel and Darkling, who told them that Bloodshed had discovered Harmony. Euphoria ordered Darkling not to kill any queens, despite the BeetleWing thinking it was what they had to do.\n\n\n== Relationships ==\n\n\n=== Magnolia ===\nMagnolia and Euphoria are implied to be in a relationship with each other. They wanted to merge their kingdoms, and in the Memory Room scene, they are seen twining their tails, holding...",
