    "name": "Dugong",
    "pageid": 102421,
    "summary": "Dugong is a male WildWing who was introduced in The Hybrid Prince. He is a descendant of Princess Bayou and was previously an underling of Taipan before standing up to him. He currently resides in the Court of Refuge and has romantic feelings for Sora.\n\n\n== Description ==\nUmber thought that Dugong looked like he could be a MudWing, or distantly related to them. He has a broad face and tree-bark brown scales with patches of dark green and dark blue on his wings. He has WildWing spikes along his spine and is bigger than Taipan and Royal. Umber described him as hulking.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nWhile an underling of Taipan, Dugong was seen as dumb. He went along with what Taipan told him to do and would let Taipan and Royal push him around. Quokka describes him as funny, and notes that he was \"so much nicer\" when not around Taipan or Royal. After leaving the palace, he did not complain nor demand to stop for food once, which Umber suspected was due to him trying to be on his best behavior for Sora.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Forgotten Isles Prophecy ===\n\n\n== Relationships ==\n\n\n=== Royal ===\nRoyal was also Taipan's underling, though Taipan respected Royal more. The two often bullied Dugong together. However...",
