    "name": "Falcon",
    "pageid": 104953,
    "summary": "Falcon was a female SkyWing who was introduced in The Hybrid Prince. She was the queen of the SkyWings over three thousand years ago until she was assassinated by Darkling and Lemur.\n\n\n== Description ==\nFalcon was tall and glamorous, with golden-orange scales. She wore a glittering crown.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nFalcon appeared to be reasonable and confident in her safety as she talked to Precipice right before she was murdered. \nWhen Umber was watching the vision of her assassination, the magic controlling the vision caused Umber to feel that Falcon is glorious, generous, kind, wise, and benevolent. It also made him feel she was the greatest queen to have ever lived, and that she could have reigned for years of peace and prosperity.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Forgotten Isles Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hybrid Prince ====\nFalcon was indirectly mentioned in the prologue, when Precipice said that her queen may not care about Harmony.\nWhen Umber was first in the Memory Room, he watched the scene of Falcon being assassinated by Darkling and Lemur. Before she was assassinated, Umber watched as she walked into her throne room in the SkyWing palace with Precipice, sat down on her throne, then told Precipice to set...",
