    "name": "Hazel",
    "pageid": 327,
    "summary": "Hazel is a female LeafWing princess who was introduced in The Poison Jungle.  When Queen Sequoia was under the control of the othermind, Hazel temporarily served as the queen of the LeafWings. Her last known whereabouts were in Sanctuary after moving to Pyrrhia with the other Pantalan refugees.\n\n\n== Description ==\nHazel has green scales, green wings, large brown eyes, and deft, dark green claws.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nHazel enjoys reading and making books, as she was always putting together her own creations or reading others'. She was shown to be critical of the shoddy binding on the Book of Clearsight, but also carefree and humorous at a point. Hazel is kind and smart, as well as an able-minded and considerate leader who genuinely cares for her suffering tribe. She is regal and poised towards her subjects, with sufficient training from Sequoia on becoming a good queen.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n=== Field Guides ===\n\n\n== Relationships ==\n\n\n=== Sequoia ===\nHazel has a very close bond with her great-grandmother, seeing her as a mother figure. She takes after Sequoia when addressing her subjects and giving them orders, showing that Hazel looks up to her great-grandmother and...",
