    "name": "Heliconia",
    "pageid": 330,
    "summary": "Heliconia is a female RainWing guard who was introduced in Winter Turning. She is one of the RainWings in Queen Glory's secret invisible guard, assigned by Deathbringer to quietly follow the queen and protect her from threats and potential assassination attempts. She currently resides in the Rainforest Kingdom.\n\n\n== Description ==\nWinter described her scales as \"a rather hideous shade of pink\".\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Jade Mountain Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== Winter Turning ====\nHeliconia was first introduced when Glory mistook her for Banana while she was following her. Heliconia was then assigned to alert the scout captains of the queen to meet Glory at the pavilion as quickly as possible, although Heliconia did not want to leave her unguarded. Glory told her that she would not be unguarded as she had multiple guards, which led her to bicker with Deathbringer.\nLater, Heliconia spoke with one of the NightWings guarding the wingery who was reluctant to allow Winter's entry, stating that he looked too \"hostile\" because Winter wanted to establish IceWing superiority at the time.\n\n\n== Gallery ==\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\tArt by Mike Holmes, from the Wings of Fire Graphic Novels...",
