    "summary": "Heliconian is an adult female SilkWing who was introduced in The Lost Continent. She was one of the ten flamesilk dragons who were imprisoned in the flamesilk factory by Ex-Queen Wasp.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nHeliconian is restless, fidgety, and glances at the exit to the flamesilk cavern a lot. She seems interested in the world beyond the factory and is one of the few flamesilks who appears interested in the thought of escaping. Danaid claimed that she ruins everything.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Lost Continent ====\nHeliconian was first mentioned in Danaid and Pierid's argument. Pierid commented on how it was not his fault Festoon overheard his secret conversation with Heliconian. Shortly after the fight, Danaid mentioned Heliconian when she listed all of the flamesilks in the factory and claimed that she \"ruins everything.\"\nBlue later visited and talked with Heliconian. Heliconian only asked him questions about the outside world, which made Blue suspect that she was unhappy in the flamesilk factory and wanted to be free.\nHeliconian was also one of the ten flamesilks shouting at each other in the commotion Danaid caused. When Whitespeck yelled at the others to...",
