    "name": "Hope",
    "pageid": 337,
    "summary": "Hope, formerly known as Foeslayer, is an adult female NightWing and was one of the three main protagonists of Runaway. Many IceWings believed that she was one of the main causes of the NightWing-IceWing War, as Hope and Arctic's forbidden relationship infuriated Queen Diamond and led her to declare war on the NightWings.\nShe was imprisoned in the Diamond Caves for over 2,000 years due to an enchantment cast by Queen Diamond, but was freed by Winter when he breathed frostbreath onto the diamond shapes on her shackles after his Diamond Trial was over. She is currently raising Peacemaker in the NightWing village.\n\n\n== Description ==\nHope is huge, with black scales that are as dark as a moonless night. She has dark green underscales, dark green eyes, a smooth, dark neck, and black wings.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nAs a dragonet, Hope was scatterbrained, likely to blurt whatever she was thinking, and passionate over things that most other dragons found pointless. She was loudmouthed, hopeful, and slightly strange. She had a sharp tongue but was not the kind of dragon to leave others in danger. She did not typically follow orders, and she was sarcastic and interesting. She would rather be a happy dragon...",
