    "pageid": 348,
    "summary": "Humpback was an elderly male SeaWing who was introduced in Darkstalker. He served as king of the SeaWings alongside his wife, Queen Lagoon. He resided in the Kingdom of the Sea before being murdered by Albatross during the Royal SeaWing Massacre.\n\n\n== Description ==\nHumpback had a creaky old voice.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nHumpback would often corner others into conversation about the grand old days of his youth.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Jade Mountain Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== Moon Rising ====\nHumpback was indirectly mentioned in the The Animus Histories as one of the nine dragons who were killed during the Royal SeaWing Massacre.\n\n\n==== Talons of Power ====\nHumpback was indirectly mentioned as one of the victims who were murdered by Albatross during the Royal SeaWing Massacre.\n\n\n=== Legends ===\n\n\n==== Darkstalker ====\nWhen Pearl, Fathom, and Indigo were getting dressed for the party, Pearl helped adjust Indigo's pearls. Indigo thanked her, and Pearl told Indigo that in return, she could distract Humpback whenever he tried to drone on and on about the old days and his scavenger supply to her. This broke the three into a laughing fit.\nAt the party, Humpback was seen alongside his wife, Queen Lagoon, and their daughter, Splash...",
