    "summary": "Hvitur was an adult male IceWing who was introduced in the prologue of The Dragonet Prophecy. He was a member of the Talons of Peace and was assigned to be one of the guardians of the dragonets. He was killed by Burn alongside the prophesied SkyWing egg during his escape from Queen Scarlet's palace.\n\n\n== Description ==\nHvitur had moon-pale, cold silver scales, silver wings, blue eyes, and a long body.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nHvitur had deep faith in the prophecy and argued for the lives of those lost in the war. He also believed that no one would harm a dragon egg.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== Pre-Series ===\nHvitur, Kestrel, Webs, Dune, and Asha were in charge of bringing the dragonets of destiny's eggs to the caves under the mountain, along with the duty to protect and raise them for the job of fulfilling the prophecy Morrowseer had foretold. Unfortunately, Asha died of her wounds shortly after delivering Clay's egg, and Hvitur was in the middle of escaping the SkyWing palace when Burn caught and killed him, stabbing him in the back of his head with her tail barb. Burn also destroyed the SkyWing egg he was supposed to deliver.\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Dragonet Prophecy ====\nIn the prologue, Hvitur...",
