    "name": "Jerboa III",
    "pageid": 383,
    "summary": "(Not to be confused with her mother Jerboa, who lived in the time of Darkstalker, or Jerboa II, Jerboa's first attempt at creating a dragonet.)\n\nJerboa III, also known as Boa, is an adult female SandWing animus dragon who was introduced in Talons of Power. She resides in her hut beside the sea, near a border shared by the Ice Kingdom and the Kingdom of Sand. She is responsible for preventing all current animus dragons from casting new spells.\n\n\n== Description ==\nJerboa has pale yellow scales. She is tall, long necked, and graceful, with wide black eyes and a dappled light brown triangle pattern on her wings. She wears a pale, fan-shaped seashell edged with darker pink on a coconut fiber cord around her neck, which is enchanted to hide her missing six claws and missing tail barb due to her mother's animus curse. Jerboa enchanted Jerboa III to stop growing at the size of a normal dragon, although she would stop growing at a size that was slightly smaller than Jerboa's. She has frown lines on her face, and moves in an odd way, as though she is secretly in pain, or her bones do not fit together quite right.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nJerboa III wants to be her own dragon and was bad-tempered around...",
