    "name": "Jewel-eyes",
    "pageid": 386,
    "summary": "Jewel-eyes was a male NightWing dragonet who was introduced in Darkstalker. He was a student of Allknowing, and possessed the ability of foresight. He resided in the lost city of night before fleeing to the NightWing island.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== Legends ===\n\n\n==== Darkstalker ====\nJewel-eyes was one of the students in the seer class when Clearsight arrived, along with Vision and Morrowwatcher. When he discovered Clearsight had special seer powers, Jewel-eyes mentioned that the class was mostly for things like figuring out whether what they saw was a dream or a vision and not controlling their seer abilities.\n\n\n== Quotes ==\n\n\n== Gallery ==\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\tArt by Jake Parker, from Darkstalker (graphic novel)",
