    "name": "Kelp",
    "pageid": 393,
    "summary": "Kelp is an adult female SeaWing who was introduced in The Lost Heir. She currently serves as a guard under Commander Shark.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nKelp seemed more reluctant to give Tsunami the keys to free Clay from his chains, showing she may have been more loyal to Shark than the rest of the guards.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Lost Heir ====\nKelp was one of the four SeaWing guards on duty when Clay was chained to the floor of the Summer Palace. The other guards were Snail, Flounder, and Herring. Tsunami eventually convinced them to free Clay, since they would be disobeying orders if they knowingly allowed the dragonets of destiny to drown while in the care of Queen Coral's guards.\n\n\n== Trivia ==\nShe was shown guarding the dragonets' cave along with Snail, Herring, and Flounder in The Lost Heir. However, Kelp and Flounder did not appear in the graphic novel adaption.",
