    "name": "Glowworm (THP)",
    "pageid": 104954,
    "summary": "(Not to be confused with Glowworm, a HiveWing from The Poison Jungle.)\n\nGlowworm is an adult male HiveWing who was introduced in The Hybrid Prince. He helped Monarch escape from Wasp Hive before they settled in the Court of Refuge. He is the father of Royal and is in a relationship with Monarch.\n\n\n== Description ==\nGlowworm has yellow-and-black scales and worried eyes. Umber described him as older.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nGlowworm is polite. He seems worrisome and tired. He is willing to use his paralyzing toxins to protect others.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== Pre-Series ===\nAt some point, he and Monarch escaped Wasp Hive together and found their way to the Court of Refuge. Years later, he would father Royal with Monarch. \n\n\n=== The Forgotten Isles Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hybrid Prince ====\nGlowworm first appeared when Platypus introduced Umber to the members of the Triumvirate.\nHe was seen again in a flashback in the Memory Room, standing alongside Monarch, helping her with her duties. When Beryl and Snakeroot attacked to overthrow the Triumvirate, he and Monarch tried to shield each other from the attacks, but were ultimately cornered. He fought through the crowd with Monarch, stabbing many dragons with his paralyzing...",
