    "name": "Glowworm (TPJ)",
    "pageid": 104955,
    "summary": "(Not to be confused with Glowworm, a HiveWing featured in The Hybrid Prince.)\n\nGlowworm is a female HiveWing dragonet who was mentioned in The Poison Jungle. She is the daughter of Inchworm.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Poison Jungle ====\nInchworm mentioned his daughter, Glowworm, as he frantically attempted to search for her. Like most HiveWings, she could be controlled by Queen Wasp, and by extension, the othermind at any time.\n\n\n== Relationships ==\n\n\n=== Inchworm ===\nInchworm was getting Glowworm ready for school when Wasp took over both dragons. Later, Inchworm's voice cracked with worry at the thought of his dragonet in war. He blurted that she had not known how to fight, and that he had to find her.\n\n\n== Family tree ==\n\n\n== References ==",
