    "name": "Harmony (THP)",
    "pageid": 104957,
    "summary": "(Not to be confused with Harmony, a village that existed over 3,000 years ago.)\n\nHarmony is a female BeetleWing-LeafWing-RainWing-SeaWing hybrid dragonet who was introduced in The Hybrid Prince. She hatched from one of the two eggs that were enchanted by Precipice that could allow the prisoners to leave the Dungeon Isle, and she was named after the ancient village of the same name. She is currently under the care of Umber, Mulberry, Quokka, Wollemi, and Nineteen.\n\n\n== Description ==\nHarmony is small and beautiful. She has color-changing scales that are red, gold, blue, and green, with shimmers of rose and lavender and silver spirals along her wings and tail. She has leaf-shaped wings, a curling tail, webs between her talons, and tiny antennae waving between her horns. She has green eyes, little claws, and a tiny snout. Umber thinks her nose is cute, that she has a sweet face, and that she is \"roly-poly perfection.\" Before she hatched, Harmony's egg was pale yellow and warm, like sunbaked sand.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== Pre-Series ===\nOver three thousand years before the events of the main series, Harmony's parents abandoned her as an egg upon fleeing from the village of the same name. Summit...",
