    "name": "Icicle (MR)",
    "pageid": 104962,
    "summary": "(Not to be confused with Icicle, an IceWing queen who ruled over three thousand years ago.)\n\nIcicle is a female IceWing dragonet princess who was introduced in Moon Rising. She formerly attended Jade Mountain Academy as a member of the Gold Winglet. After her failed attempt to murder the dragonets of destiny, she escaped Jade Mountain and fled to the Rainforest Kingdom, where she was soon arrested by Glory and Deathbringer. She is currently imprisoned and awaiting trial in the Ice Kingdom.\n\n\n== Description ==\nIcicle has gleaming white scales. She is pristine, with pale, arctic blue eyes. She is haughty-looking, with a smooth, high-pitched voice. Her claws are sharp, her teeth gleam, and her spines are pristine even after clubbing a walrus to death; she plunged into the ocean six times a day before attending Jade Mountain Academy in order to appear clean, because she claims that a glittering IceWing is a more intimidating one.  She is larger than Winter and most RainWings. Later on, when she went into hiding, Winter described her to have bloodshot eyes, and that she was caked in mud and blood.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nAccording to Winter, Icicle is brilliant, dangerous, ferocious, and prefers...",
