    "summary": "(Not to be confused with Icicle, Winter's sister.)\n\nIcicle was a female IceWing who was mentioned in The Hybrid Prince. She was the queen of the IceWings over three thousand years ago.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Forgotten Isles Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hybrid Prince ====\nSora showed Umber a record of the early days of the Dungeon Isle. She told him that Queen Summit and Queen Retribution were in charge of the trial against the BeetleWings and LeafWings, and Queen Icicle, along with Queen Hibiscus and Queen Dolphin, were three of the five other queens that signed the sentencing document.\n\n\n== Family tree ==\n\n    = Possible timeline",
