    "name": "Lagoon (TLH)",
    "pageid": 412,
    "summary": "(Not to be confused with Lagoon, the SeaWing queen in Darkstalker.)\n\nLagoon is an adult female SeaWing who was introduced in The Lost Heir. She is a member of the SeaWing Council and is in charge of preparing food for the council meetings. Her official Council title is Aquaculture.\n\n\n== Description ==\nLagoon is plump, with turquoise scales.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Lost Heir ====\nAfter the dragonets were imprisoned, Queen Coral told Lagoon to make sure they were well fed. However, Lagoon neglected them, and only fed them tiny crabs and other small breakfast leftovers from the feasts that were served during the council meetings. When Tsunami visited the dragonets, she found out that they were not given enough food, and that Clay had been chained up and forced to wait out the storm, where Clay would have most likely died. She told her mother, Queen Coral, and the SeaWing queen sent Lagoon to prison. Tsunami suspected her uncle, Shark, or even Queen Coral, of being the one who gave the order for Clay to be shackled, though it is still unknown who did it. Queen Coral pretended to be shocked and angry because Lagoon and Shark disobeyed her commands and had the two of...",
