    "name": "Lappet",
    "pageid": 415,
    "summary": "Lappet is a male SilkWing who was introduced in The Dangerous Gift. He was formerly a member of the Chrysalis and his last known whereabouts were in Sanctuary.\n\n\n== Description ==\nLappet has pale gray and brown scales with hints of purple and is smaller than Queen Snowfall. He has a triangle of old, deliberate scars carved into his palm, with the largest being an L for his name.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nLappet is cautious, agreeable, nervous, sleepy, and slow to answer questions. The first strong emotion Snowfall saw him display was anger towards the HiveWings.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Dangerous Gift ====\nLappet and Snowfall were having a brief conversation while she was talking to him about the strange visions she was having. Snowfall was also bothering him with many questions about the Chrysalis, and he was shown to be extremely suspicious of her actions.\n\n\n== Quotes ==\n\n\n== Gallery ==\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n== References ==",
