    "name": "Lionfish",
    "pageid": 428,
    "summary": "Lionfish was a male SeaWing who was introduced in Darkstalker. As a guard, he accompanied Fathom during his visit to the Night Kingdom alongside Indigo and Wharf. He resided in the Kingdom of the Sea.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nLionfish seemed pleased when he killed Quickdeath, satisfied that he had been able to complete his job.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== Legends ===\n\n\n==== Darkstalker ====\nLionfish was one of the soldiers, along with Wharf and Indigo, who were ordered by Queen Pearl to accompany Fathom to the Night Kingdom. He later killed Quickdeath after the assassin attempted to murder Darkstalker.\nIndigo guessed that Lionfish, along with Wharf, likely returned to the Kingdom of the Sea after the NightWings fled the Night Kingdom.\n\n\n== Gallery ==\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\tArt by Jake Parker, from Darkstalker (graphic novel)\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n== References ==",
