    "name": "Loris",
    "pageid": 432,
    "summary": "Loris is a RainWing of unknown gender who was mentioned in The Hidden Kingdom. They were one of the seventeen RainWings who were captured by the NightWings. They returned to the rainforest after being set free by Queen Glory in The Dark Secret.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hidden Kingdom ====\nAfter Glory challenged Magnificent for the throne, Kinkajou mentioned Loris along with Gibbon, Orchid, Splendor, and Tualang when she said that the RainWings were going to have a proper queen for once. She retorted that they should have asked the captured RainWings instead because those prisoners were not rescued when Magnificent and the others were queen, noting that Magnificent had not noticed that they were gone, and Glory was the only one who tried to find them.",
