    "name": "Lubber",
    "pageid": 434,
    "summary": "Lubber is an adult female HiveWing who was mentioned in The Lost Continent. She is the principal of Cricket's school, Terrarium Academy.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nBased on Cricket's commentary on Blue's imitation, Lubber appears to be unkind and greedy like most of her tribe. She is also outwardly cruel, having shredded Cricket's artwork and banning her from participating in the art class.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Lost Continent ====\nWhen Blue imitated a teacher remarking on how awful Cricket's artwork was, Cricket laughed and told him that he sounded exactly like Principal Lubber. When Blue assured her that her artwork was beautiful, Cricket responded that it was a beautiful pile of scraps when Lubber was \"done with it.\" Afterwards, Lubber banned Cricket from participating in art class at Terrarium Academy.\n\n\n== Quotes ==\n\n\n== References ==",
