    "name": "Mindhealer",
    "pageid": 462,
    "summary": "Mindhealer is a male NightWing dragonet who was featured in A Guide to the Dragon World. He is a character in a story from Tales of the NightWings where he is Comet's friend. He resides in the lost city of night.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nMindhealer was kind and understanding. He was described as being a skilled reader of other dragons' emotions.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== Pre-Series ===\nMindhealer attended school with Comet and would comfort him when other dragons were cruel. After Comet had a vision of a hurricane coming, Mindhealer went with him to warn the queen.\nWhen the queen did not believe Comet, Mindhealer and Comet searched for all of the dragons who believed Comet and brought them to safety from the hurricane.\n\n\n=== Field Guides ===\n\n\n==== A Guide to the Dragon World ====\nMindhealer was featured in the NightWing chapter of the guide in the Tales of the NightWings.\n\n\n== Relationships ==\n\n\n=== Comet ===\nMindhealer was kind to Comet, even when no other dragons were. He would comfort Comet when the other dragons were mean and supported him when they went to tell the queen about Comet's vision.\n\n\n== References ==",
