    "name": "Mindreader",
    "pageid": 463,
    "summary": "Mindreader is a female NightWing dragonet who was introduced in The Dark Secret. She is a student attending Jade Mountain Academy as a member of the Copper Winglet. Despite her name, Mindreader did not possess the ability to read minds until Talons of Power, when Darkstalker used his animus magic to enchant her bracelet.\n\n\n== Description ==\nMindreader has black scales. Her item enchanted by Darkstalker is a bracelet of green and silver glass beads strung along a twisted black wire.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nMindreader is curious, compassionate, inquisitive, and eager. Mindreader seems to be more accepting of Queen Glory and happier about her new life in the rainforest than most NightWings. She appears to be wry, as she joked about the irony of her name, other dragons often remark on and laugh at that irony too. In reality she wished she could read minds and when Darkstalker granted her mind reading abilities, she was ecstatic. After gaining her powers she would read and announce other's thoughts gleefully, she also seemed to be a little more smug and mocking. Mindreader described herself as \"not a blackmailing sort of dragon.\"\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Dark Secret... ====",
