    "name": "Mink",
    "pageid": 465,
    "summary": "Mink is a female IceWing dragonet princess who was introduced in The Dangerous Gift. She currently resides in the IceWing palace and is the younger sister of Queen Snowfall and Crystal.\n\n\n== Description ==\nMink is tiny, with wide, giant, dark blue, seal-like eyes. Her scales are white with feathery patterns of gray along her wings like whiskers or tufts of fur.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nMink is thoughtful, happy, fidgety, gentle, bashful, shy, sweet, flibbertigibbet, and loves nearly everyone she encounters. She is beloved and affectionately lovely. She is described as sweet and caring, and likes to give out small ice sculpted gifts to everyone in the kingdom.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Jade Mountain Prophecy ===\n  \n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n=== The Forgotten Isles Prophecy ===\n\n\n=== Field Guides ===\n\n\n== Relationships ==\n\n\n=== Glacier ===\nWhen Glacier was dying, Mink sobbed beside her mother, and they both loved each other dearly.\n\n\n=== Polar Bear ===\nMink told Polar Bear multiple times that she thought he was special, to which he reacted in confused appreciation. She thinks of him as a friend.\n\n\n=== Snowfall ===\nSince becoming queen, Snowfall had not interacted with her younger sister that often. Despite Mink...",
