    "name": "Monarch (TLC)",
    "pageid": 473,
    "summary": "(Not to be confused with the other SilkWings, Monarch and Monarch, two of the greatest queens in SilkWing history.)\n\nMonarch is an adult female SilkWing who was introduced in The Hybrid Prince. She was the last queen of the SilkWings, ruling before the Tree Wars about fifty years ago. She gave up her throne and allowed her tribe to be ruled by Queen Wasp and the HiveWings. Sometime after being imprisoned, a HiveWing named Glowworm helped her escape from Wasp Hive. They fled to the Court of Refuge and became trapped on the Dungeon Isle. Monarch was elected as a member of the Triumvirate, where she now helps rule the Court. She is the partner of Glowworm and the mother of Royal.\n\n\n== Description ==\nMonarch is beautiful, with orange scales, long antennae, and blue and white markings along her wings and by her eyes. She has scars around her ankles and along her throat, and is missing one of her back claws. According to Umber, she looks like she has not slept in a really long time. \n\n\n== Personality ==\nMonarch loves her tribe and would do anything to protect her dragons. She is conflicted, yielding, optimistic, and doubtful. She is also generous and trusting. She got anxious and sad at the threat...",
