    "name": "Needle",
    "pageid": 501,
    "summary": "Needle is an adult female SandWing who was mentioned in Deserter. She was a general under Queen Oasis and resided in the SandWing stronghold.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== Winglets ===\n\n\n==== Deserter ====\nNeedle was mentioned to have complimented Dune on his skill at being a soldier, which he bragged about shortly before the scavengers who started the War of SandWing Succession arrived at the palace and killed Oasis. Later, Burn told Needle that two sisters out there lurking and scheming was just annoying — but armies coming to attack her, that she could handle, as it meant violence and mayhem and fun.",
