    "name": "Lemur",
    "pageid": 104966,
    "summary": "Lemur was a male RainWing who was introduced in The Hybrid Prince. He was Queen Hibiscus's top assassin who assassinated Queen Falcon under her orders, along with Darkling.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Forgotten Isles Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hybrid Prince ====\nLemur appeared in the a past vision of Queen Falcon's assassination in the Memory Room. Umber watched Lemur attack the SkyWing queen alongside Darkling. Lemur questioned if Darkling was sure she wanted to do this, but Darkling told him that they had orders.\nWhen Queen Retribution and Queen Summit discussed the creation of the Dungeon Isle, it was mentioned that Lemur managed to escape after claiming that Queen Hibiscus set him and Darkling up. However, Retribution brought up the fact that Hibiscus punished everyone related to Lemur by banishing them all to the island.",
