    "name": "Ochre",
    "pageid": 523,
    "summary": "Ochre is an adult male MudWing who was introduced in The Hidden Kingdom. He was formerly part of the false dragonets of destiny organized by Morrowseer as the replacement for Clay. He is currently a member of the Talons of Peace.\n\n\n== Description ==\nOchre has dark mahogany-brown scales and dull eyes. When Fatespeaker introduced Starflight to the false dragonets, she called him \"the fat one,\" which corresponds with how he is shown to be eating both a lot and often.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nOchre is described as being clumsy, uncaring, greedy, pushy, unlikeable, disagreeable, and pessimistic. Sunny describes him as the unfunny and unpleasant version of Clay and even during their first encounter, she felt there was something about him that rubbed her the wrong way. He is shown to have a voracious appetite and refuses to share with anyone else. Flame referred to him as an idiot.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n=== The Jade Mountain Prophecy ===\n\n\n== Quotes ==\n\n\n== Trivia ==\nOchre's tongue was described as forked. However, MudWings do not have forked tongues.\nOchre hatched on the same day as Flame, a couple of weeks before the brightest night.\n\n\n== Gallery... ==",
