    "name": "Ocotillo",
    "pageid": 524,
    "summary": "Ocotillo is a male SandWing who was introduced in The Hidden Kingdom. He guarded Blaze at her fortress during the War of SandWing Succession.\n\n\n== Description ==\nOcotillo was described to be heavyset, with broken claws on one talon. \n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hidden Kingdom ====\nOcotillo was stationed at Blaze's fortress when Glory and Jambu, disguised as IceWings, came to visit. Blaze ordered him to bring them tea and dried lizards, assuming there were some left. Later, when Jambu stated that he liked the tapestries adorning the walls of the fortress, Ocotillo seemed surprised and said that most IceWings who visited the fortress viewed them as \"garish and gaudy.\"\n\n\n== Quotes ==\n\n\n== Gallery ==\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\tArt by Mike Holmes, from the Wings of Fire Graphic Novels\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n== References ==",
