    "name": "Onyx",
    "pageid": 532,
    "summary": "Onyx is an adult female SandWing princess who was introduced in Moon Rising. She formerly attended Jade Mountain Academy as a member of the Gold Winglet. Named after the Eye of Onyx, she was hatched as a fugitive in the Kingdom of Sand and raised in isolation by her mother, Palm, before the latter's death. She currently resides in the SandWing stronghold, recovering from a serious leg injury with her father, Smolder.\n\n\n== Description ==\nOnyx is large and muscular, with pale yellow scales and branching black lines tattooed on her horns and neck. She has small black diamonds embedded between the scales along her wings and wears a metal amulet around her neck that contains the twisted hunk of skyfire that killed Palm. The stone is bound to the amulet by copper wires. One of her hind talons was crushed during a sandstorm, injured to the point where she will likely never be able to walk on it again. She has a rangy, black-diamond-studded form and very black eyes.  \n\n\n== Personality ==\nOnyx dislikes being questioned, and while she typically acts nice to other dragons to their faces, she often rolls her eyes and makes fun of others behind their back, and believes that the most beautiful things...",
