    "name": "Pearl (TLH)",
    "pageid": 555,
    "summary": "(Not to be confused with Queen Pearl, a SeaWing queen in Darkstalker.)\n\nPearl is a SeaWing of unknown gender who was introduced in The Lost Heir. They serve as the treasurer of the SeaWing Council.\n\n\n== Description ==\nPearl is elegant and has pale green scales.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Lost Heir ====\nPearl was seen eating breakfast with Queen Coral, the royal daughters, and the SeaWing council. Pearl was the dragon who sat in the treasury pool, and when Queen Coral asked them to report, the councilor stated that all of the Queen's jewels were safe, as no scavengers could get to them and no dragon would dare to attempt to steal them.\n\n\n== Quotes ==\n\n\n== Gallery ==\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n== References ==",
