    "name": "Penguin",
    "pageid": 556,
    "summary": "Penguin was an animus IceWing of unknown gender who was mentioned in Darkstalker. They created the gift of diplomacy.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== Legends ===\n\n\n==== Darkstalker ====\nIn the prologue, Prince Arctic mentioned to Foeslayer that Penguin had created the gift of diplomacy, which contributed to making the area around the IceWing guest dome warm all the time so that guests from other tribes would feel more comfortable. Arctic considered improving the dome so it would be protected from fire, but then dismissed the idea. Arctic wanted to make a very useful and important animus gift, like Frostbite's gift of light.\n\n\n=== Field Guides ===\n\n\n==== A Guide to the Dragon World ====\nPenguin was mentioned in Snowfall's notes on historical IceWing gifts as being the creator of the gift of diplomacy.\n\n\n== Family tree ==\n\n    = Possible timeline\n\n\n== Known Enchantments ==\n\n\n== References ==",
