    "name": "Pademelon",
    "pageid": 104968,
    "summary": "Pademelon is an adult female WildWing who was introduced in The Hybrid Prince. She was a member of the King's Teeth, but sided with the Triumvirate when they came to overthrow Beryl. She resides in the Court of Refuge.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Forgotten Isles Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hybrid Prince ====\nPademelon was one of the dragons in the council room when the Triumvirate returned to overthrow Beryl. Beryl ordered Pademelon to tackle Monarch, but Pademelon refused, beaming when Monarch asked about her dragonet and how they must have mastered catching hawks.\n\n\n== Quotes ==",
