    "name": "Quoll",
    "pageid": 104976,
    "summary": "Quoll is a male WildWing who was introduced in The Hybrid Prince. He was one of the dragons Umber trained in the King's Teeth and resides in the Court of Refuge.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Forgotten Isles Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hybrid Prince ====\nQuoll was one of the two King's Teeth who was guarding the outside of Beryl's tower when Umber and Platypus went to rescue Mulberry. To sneak in, Aurora gave the two something that smelled like chocolate and coconut and was covered in sleep powder. Quoll immediately shoved three of them in his mouth as soon as Aurora said he and Ravine could have them.\n\n\n== Quotes ==\n\n\n== References ==",
