    "name": "Sapphire",
    "pageid": 683,
    "summary": "Sapphire was an adult female SeaWing princess who was mentioned in Darkstalker. After losing her claws to a clamshell enchanted by Albatross, she went insane and was stationed on a remote island within the Kingdom of the Sea under the care of two very well-paid servants. \n\n\n== Description ==\nSapphire had no claws. She was bigger than Albatross as a dragonet, and he described her as looking like \"a feeble old duck.\"\n\n\n== Personality ==\nSapphire was mocking towards Albatross when they were younger, reminding him that once she began ruling the Kingdom of the Sea, she would own everything, even beach trash. After the clamshell incident, she devolved into insanity.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== Legends ===\n\n\n=== Field Guides ===\n\n\n== Family tree ==\n\n\n== Quotes ==\n\n\n== Gallery ==\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\tArt by Jake Parker, from Darkstalker (graphic novel)\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n== References ==",
