    "name": "Scald",
    "pageid": 685,
    "summary": "Scald was an adult male SandWing prince who was introduced in Deserter. He was one of King Char and Queen Oasis's three sons. He was killed by Burn during the War of SandWing Succession. Prior to his death, he resided in the SandWing stronghold.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Brightest Night ====\nScald was mentioned indirectly when Smolder told Sunny that his brothers were killed because they \"made the wrong dragons mad.\"\n\n\n=== Winglets ===\n\n\n==== Deserter ====\nScald was ineffectively trying to comfort Smolder alongside his brother Singe, after the disappearance of Palm. He was also present at the meeting after Queen Oasis was killed by Stone and discussed with his brothers and sisters on who will be next queen of the SandWings. He was later killed by Burn.\n\n\n=== Field Guides ===\n\n\n==== A Guide to the Dragon World ====\nScald was mentioned by Smolder in his observations on Rose in the SandWing chapter of the guide.\n\n\n== Family tree ==\n\n\n== Quotes ==\n\n\n== Trivia ==\nScald once mentioned that he had three girlfriends.\n\n\n== References ==",
