    "name": "Scallop",
    "pageid": 686,
    "summary": "Scallop was a male SeaWing prince who was introduced in Darkstalker. He was one of the cousins of Fathom and Pearl, and the brother of Current. He was killed by Albatross during the Royal SeaWing Massacre.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nScallop was polite.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Jade Mountain Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== Moon Rising ====\nScallop was indirectly mentioned as one of the nine dragons who were killed by Albatross in the scroll, The Animus Histories.\n\n\n==== Talons of Power ====\nScallop was indirectly mentioned as one of the victims that Albatross claimed during the Royal SeaWing Massacre.\n\n\n=== Legends ===\n\n\n==== Darkstalker ====\nPrince Scallop was first mentioned indirectly by Fathom when he said that his cousins mostly ignored him, politely uninterested in his stories.\nScallop was later seen briefly, talking and laughing with the rest of his family at the welcoming feast for Sunset and Eagle just before the massacre when Albatross killed him among others, including his father, Eel. In the aftermath of the massacre, his body was presumably found by Fathom and Indigo.\n\n\n== Family tree ==\n\n\n== References ==",
