    "name": "Scarab",
    "pageid": 687,
    "summary": "Scarab is an elderly female HiveWing royal who was introduced in The Lost Continent. She formerly served as the Minister of Education and currently resides on Pantala. She is the mother of Jewel.\n\n\n== Description ==\nScarab is a lean, skinny, elderly HiveWing with lemon-yellow scales, black stripes on her wings, black horns, and ruby scales freckling her nose and tail. Her eyes are small, and resemble dark coals, with hints of dark red in their depths.  She wears a pair of spectacles,  and she has a wintry smile.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nDespite her snappy remarks on Cricket's numerous questions, Scarab demonstrates great respect for all dragons, regardless of their tribe or status. Blue describes her as \"fiercely not awful.\" She seems to take an interest in painting. She is intent and blunt, and is not accustomed to gentleness. She does not seem to care about what other dragons think of her and seemed to dislike everyone.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n== Relationships ==\n\n\n=== Cricket ===\nScarab first came up in a conversation between Blue and Cricket, and ended up being deeply involved in Cricket's life. Scarab believed Cricket was smart due to Malachite's genetics, and seemed...",
