    "name": "Splendor",
    "pageid": 752,
    "summary": "Splendor is an adult female RainWing who was introduced in The Dark Secret. She was one of the six queens who took turns ruling the tribe before Glory took the throne, and was the first to be taken prisoner by the NightWings until Glory and Starflight freed her.\n\n\n== Description ==\nSplendor is described as skeletal and drab-gray while she was imprisoned in the NightWing dungeons. However, her lean figure may be due to lack of nutrition while in the dungeons, and her coloration a result of her reactions to the miserable condition she was in.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hidden Kingdom ====\nAccording to Mangrove, Splendor was the first of the RainWings to be kidnapped by NightWings. Kinkajou later mentioned her as one of the captured RainWings, when she was in the NightWing fortress. The other RainWings had brushed off her disappearance, and the other queens just skipped her turn.\n\n\n==== The Dark Secret ====\nIt was revealed the NightWings assumed that if they captured the RainWings' queen, the tribe would obey them, seeing their queen at their mercy. However, this plan failed, as there was not much of a RainWing monarchy, and most RainWings barely even noticed her absence...",
