    "pageid": 753,
    "summary": "Squid is an adult male SeaWing who was introduced in The Hidden Kingdom. He was a member of the false dragonets of destiny as a replacement for Tsunami, and is currently a member of the Talons of Peace. He is the son of Nautilus, who was formerly the leader of the Talons of Peace.\n\n\n== Description ==\nSquid has emerald-green scales and green wings. He is rather small, barely the size of a three-year-old dragonet. He is much scrawnier than Winter and smaller than Riptide.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nSquid is obsessed with treasure, gold, and jewels, even more than fame and peace. He is frequently whiny, as he believes he is famous and gets irritable when he is not treated like it. He often thinks very highly of himself, due to him being both the son of the leader of the Talons of Peace and a \"dragonet of destiny\". As such, he often tries to lord this fact over the other false dragonets, despite being often met with backlash. When Morrowseer called him small, he claimed that he \"has a big personality\", like he had been told that enough times for everyone to know it was true. He is shown to be cowardly and childish when it comes to real work.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n=== The Jade... ===",
