    "name": "Starclaws",
    "pageid": 755,
    "summary": "Starclaws was an adult NightWing of unknown gender who was introduced in Runaway. They went with Prudence, Foeslayer, and Discretion on a diplomatic mission to the Ice Kingdom in an attempt to negotiate an alliance with the IceWings. \n\n\n== Description ==\nStarclaws had black scales.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== Legends ===\n\n\n==== Darkstalker ====\nStarclaws was mentioned by Foeslayer as one of the four dragons who were sent on a diplomatic mission to the Ice Kingdom when she met Arctic.\n\n\n=== Winglets ===\n\n\n==== Runaway ====\nDuring Foeslayer and Arctic's escape from the IceWing palace, Prudence gathered up Starclaws and Discretion to get them ready to leave with the group. Starclaws followed Prudence to a cliff outside the palace, where they met up with Arctic and Foeslayer. They then left the kingdom with Prudence, Foeslayer, Arctic, and Discretion.\n\n\n== Gallery ==\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n== References ==",
