    "name": "Strongwings",
    "pageid": 760,
    "summary": "Strongwings is an adult male NightWing who was introduced in The Dark Secret. He was formerly a scientific assistant to Mastermind and currently he resides in Renewal. He is in a relationship with Fierceteeth.\n\n\n== Description ==\nStrongwings has black scales and black eyes. He is beefy, large, and burly, nearly twice the size of Fierceteeth, with a large back and massive shoulders. He looks ill and underfed, with huge, strong wings. His version of a smile includes baring his teeth awkwardly at the other dragon.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nFierceteeth describes Strongwings as \"not the sharpest claw on the dragon.\" He is stout, clumsy, slow, and has low self-esteem, frequently expressing how he believes that he is stupid. He also took the blame when he and Fierceteeth got caught by Morrowseer and Deadlyclaws for entering the animus tunnels, showing his selflessness. While Fierceteeth schemed during their imprisonment, Strongwings caught up on sleeping and eating. While he lived on the NightWing island, he was a notorious mess and possibly the slowest dragon in the tribe. He left bits of carcasses around his sleeping spot and accidentally stepped on everyone's tails on his way to bed at night. He...",
