    "summary": "Temora is a female SilkWing and a former member of the Jewel Hive Chrysalis who was mentioned in The Hive Queen.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nTemora was mentioned by the Jewel Hive Chrysalis to be \"too tired\" to show up to any of their meetings.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hive Queen ====\nTau and Morpho mentioned Temora in a conversation with Sundew, saying she was \"too tired\" to come to the meeting in the library.\n\n\n== References ==",
