    "name": "Tempest",
    "pageid": 791,
    "summary": "Tempest was an adult female SeaWing who was introduced in Assassin. She was a commander of the SeaWing army under Queen Coral until she was killed by Deathbringer during a diplomatic meeting with several MudWing leaders. Her death ultimately caused the MudWings to leave Blister's alliance and join Burn's army due to the SeaWings losing trust in their allies.\n\n\n== Description ==\nTempest was towering, enormous, and powerfully built, with turquoise scales. She was described to be as big as Morrowseer, with broad shoulders, gleaming teeth, and a healing burn scar on her neck. She had a trident longer than Deathbringer strapped to her back, and a booming, big, jovial voice. She had a startling, booming bark of a laugh.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nTempest was loud, intelligent, and fearless. She was influential among the SeaWings and appeared to be well-liked among her tribe.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Dark Secret ====\nDeathbringer indirectly mentioned Tempest to Starflight when he asked if Starflight noticed that if a side was winning the war, their top general would disappear, alluding to the missions he did on the continent which includes the assassination of Commander Tempest...",
