    "name": "The Librarian",
    "pageid": 828,
    "summary": "The Librarian is an adult female HiveWing who was introduced in The Lost Continent. She had spent most of her life being controlled by Ex-Queen Wasp using the breath of evil. She took the job of the Librarian protecting and watching over the Book of Clearsight thinking it was an honor, but later found out that Wasp mind-controlled her day and night. Therefore, she never got to read or even see the Book of Clearsight in reality. She is currently taking refuge in the LeafSilk Kingdom.\n\n\n== Description ==\nThe Librarian has pale orange scales the color of unripe apricots, marked with a zigzagging triangle pattern of black along her spine and tail. She is tall and bony and wears a dark silk veil that shrouds her face as well as the key to the Book of Clearsight around her neck. When she is not being controlled by Queen Wasp, she has dark orange eyes. She has long, retractable stingers under her claws, and is fairly large and strong.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nThe Librarian was described by the guards to \"like unusual things\" and is also \"less murdery than the queen.\" She appeared to be kind, willing to help Blue and the others escape with the Book.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy... ===",
