    "name": "Thorn",
    "pageid": 848,
    "summary": "Thorn is an adult female SandWing who was introduced in The Brightest Night. She is the mother of Sunny and was formerly in a relationship with Stonemover, an animus dragon. She was formerly the leader of the Outclaws until she became queen of the SandWing tribe during the events of The Brightest Night. She resided in the SandWing stronghold before her disappearance.\n\n\n== Description ==\nThorn is small, wiry, and compact, looking as though she will stay that way no matter how long she lives. She has pale sandy yellow scales that are dappled with small brown sand like speckles along her spine and wings. A golden chain of flying dragons, crafted from twisted wires, encircles one of her upper forearms, and she wears a simple copper chain with a moonstone pendant around her neck. The Eye of Onyx hangs on a chain around her neck, with the onyx stone and the golden dragon wings in the center of her chest, bumping against the moonstone. She has kind, dark black eyes and warm, strong wings. She wears a toothy grin and wears an enchanted earring identical to Qibli's. Her voice is calm and clear.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nThorn is perceptive, reassuring, no-nonsense, astute, calmly certain, friendly, cheerful...",
