    "name": "Treehopper",
    "pageid": 861,
    "summary": "Treehopper is an adult male HiveWing who was introduced in The Hive Queen. Formerly Lady Jewel's treasurer at Jewel Hive, he currently resides in the LeafSilk Kingdom with his partner, Tau.\n\n\n== Description ==\nTreehopper has dark greenish-black scales with pale orange stripes along his wings, tail, and face. He is plump and worried-looking.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nHe seems to be a kinder HiveWing than most. Despite the risk of a forbidden relationship in the Hives, Treehopper's relationship with Tau is said to be obvious, implying that the couple might not be very secretive. He blames himself when Queen Wasp enters his mind. Tau once said that he would never harm innocent dragons.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hive Queen ====\nTreehopper was seen reading a book before Tau, a SilkWing, approached him. He began a conversation with Tau, the two laughed and their wings brushed occasionally. However, during the conversation he was abruptly taken over by Queen Wasp. Luckily, the queen did not discover their relationship. When he was himself again, he apologized to Tau, who reassured him that it was not his fault.\n\n\n==== The Dangerous Gift ====\nOne of Queen Snowfall's visions was...",
