    "summary": "Tsetse is an adult female HiveWing who was mentioned in The Hive Queen. She is one of the sisters of Ex-Queen Wasp, and the former ruler of Tsetse Hive. She is currently imprisoned in the flamesilk factory alongside her other sisters.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hive Queen ====\nWhen Scarab talked to Cricket about Wasp's mind control, the former indirectly mentioned Tsetse when she stated that the mind control did not work on herself or any of Wasp's sisters.\n\n\n==== The Poison Jungle ====\nWhen Grayling was talking to Bryony, he indirectly mentioned Tsetse while comparing Bloodworm's sisters.\n\n\n==== The Flames of Hope ====\nTsetse was indirectly mentioned when Luna said that Wasp and the rest of her sisters had been imprisoned in the flamesilk caverns.\n\n\n== Family tree ==",
