    "pageid": 874,
    "summary": "Tussock is a male SilkWing who was mentioned in The Lost Continent. According to Blue, his uncle was said to have seen a LeafWing flying around a few years ago.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Lost Continent ====\nWhile arguing with Luna about the potential existence of LeafWings, Blue mentioned Tussock. They briefly discussed the LeafWing that Tussock's uncle allegedly saw from a distance, but Luna believed the story to be a fabrication or misinterpretation, dismissing the sighting as a green SilkWing.",
