    "name": "Sunset (W5)",
    "pageid": 101784,
    "summary": "(Not to be confused with Sunset, a SkyWing princess featured in Darkstalker.)\n\nSunset is a female SkyWing dragonet who was introduced in Hero. She is a friend of Cliff's from the SkyWing wingery.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== Winglets ===\n\n\n==== Hero ====\nWhile guessing who his father was, Cliff mentioned Sunset when he said he did not want his father to be Russet because he had taken Sunset's candy away after she sneezed on him.\nAfter Scarlet was attacked by Glory in the SkyWing arena, Cliff ran into Sunset in the hallway. They decided to figure out what happened, and argued over whether Scarlet could have been killed by a scavenger like Queen Oasis had.\nLater when Jasper mentioned that Oasis had been killed by a scavenger, Cliff thought about how Sunset was right, as he had thought the SandWing queen was killed by a hedgehog.\n\n\n== Trivia ==\nCliff stated that everything makes Sunset throw up.\n\n\n== References ==",
