    "name": "Tuatara",
    "pageid": 104988,
    "summary": "Tuatara is an adult female WildWing who was introduced in The Hybrid Prince. She is one of the members of the Triumvirate and resides in the Court of Refuge.\n\n\n== Description ==\nTuatara is covered in thorny spikes from nose to tail. According to Platypus, she is one of the oldest WildWings in the Court of Refuge.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nPlatypus described her as the smartest WildWing in court. She is kind, polite, and diplomatic.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Forgotten Isles Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hybrid Prince ====\nTuatara first appeared when Platypus introduced Umber to the Triumvirate.\nWhen Umber, Platypus, and Quokka were in the Memory Room, Tuatara was shown grappling with Beryl on the dais in the throne room. After scuffling for a long while, she was tired and wounded, and Horizon came to let her lean on him. She told Horizon to fly away with Monarch and Glowworm, but he refused to leave her. They then ran for an open window to flee the court with the other members of the Triumvirate.\nShe was present with the other Triumvirate members when Umber, Platypus, and Quokka came to visit after viewing memories in the Memory Room, and she chuckled at Umber's mention of wanting to escape the Barrier.\nWhen...",
