    "name": "Urchin",
    "pageid": 879,
    "summary": "Urchin is a male SeaWing who was introduced in the The Lost Heir. He currently works as a messenger under Queen Coral and resides in the Kingdom of the Sea.\n\n\n== Description ==\nUrchin is small and lithe.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nUrchin appears to be very polite and loyal.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Lost Heir ====\nUrchin was the first SeaWing to find Kestrel's dead body, which was just a few islands away from the Summer Palace. He told Moray about it, who then informed Coral.\nAfterward, Urchin sat in the SeaWing Council as Coral's messenger, despite him not being a Council member.\nUrchin later arrived at the scene when Webs returned to the Summer Palace and reported to Coral that Piranha had captured a suspicious dragon, possibly one working with Webs. This dragon turned out to be Riptide.\n\n\n== Gallery ==\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n== References ==",
