    "name": "Vigilance",
    "pageid": 884,
    "summary": "Vigilance was an adult female NightWing who was introduced in Darkstalker. She ruled as queen of the NightWings during Darkstalker's era. After Clearsight's warning, she fled from the lost city of night to the NightWing island alongside her tribe. \n\n\n== Description ==\nVigilance had sharp, glinting, pitch-black eyes. She wore an ostentatious crown, and her wings were loaded with diamonds. Arctic described her as regal and radiant. She had a thin and sinister smile.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nVigilance was sharp, glowering, suspicious, intimidating, and shrewd. A large amount of her apparent menace came from the fact that she spoke very little, allowing the dragons around her to fill in all the gaps with their own nervous chatter. She was also deeply paranoid, killing off perceived threats long before they were genuinely dangerous. She was anxious and shortsighted, and she was not very susceptible to flattery, as she found compliments highly suspicious. She enjoyed trifling with nervous dragons by remaining silent. She loved conducting business whenever it might seem peculiar to other dragons, and adopted an aura of furiousness and chilly stillness when she was displeased. She was not particularly...",
