    "pageid": 886,
    "summary": "Vinegaroon is an adult female HiveWing who was mentioned in The Hive Queen. She was the former ruler of Vinegaroon Hive. She is a sister of Ex-Queen Wasp, and is currently imprisoned in the flamesilk factory alongside her other sisters.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Lost Continent Prophecy ===\n\n\n==== The Hive Queen ====\nVinegaroon was indirectly mentioned when Scarab talked to Cricket about Wasp's mind control, and how it did not work on herself or on any of Wasp's sisters.\n\n\n==== The Poison Jungle ====\nWhen Grayling was talking to Bryony, he indirectly mentioned Vinegaroon while comparing Bloodworm's sisters.\n\n\n==== The Flames of Hope ====\nVinegaroon was indirectly mentioned when Luna said that Wasp and the rest of her sisters had been imprisoned in the flamesilk caverns.\n\n\n== Family tree ==",
