    "name": "Viper",
    "pageid": 889,
    "summary": "Viper was a female SandWing dragonet who was introduced in The Hidden Kingdom. She was a member of the false dragonets of destiny as a replacement for Sunny. She was killed on the NightWing island during a battle training session with Flame, where she was pushed into a lava pit by Starflight while he was defending Fatespeaker.\n\n\n== Description ==\nViper had white-gold scales.\n\n\n== Personality ==\nSimilar to the other false dragonets, she was very annoyed by Fatespeaker's imprecise and false predictions and found amusement in bullying Squid. She seemed to also take pleasure in abusing Fatespeaker, nearly to the point of killing the NightWing, due to her hatred of all NightWings for taking her away from her family. She acted aggressively to anyone she met and usually kept to herself, but if anyone came too close, she would threaten them with her tail to scare them away. Starflight thought that Viper seemed like the exact opposite of Sunny. She acted as if she would rather die than stay on the NightWing island. She was very strong and could get angered easily.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== The Dragonet Prophecy ===\n\n\n=== The Jade Mountain Prophecy ===\n\n\n== Quotes ==\n\n\n== Trivia ==\nViper's name was originally going...",
