    "name": "Vision",
    "pageid": 890,
    "summary": "Vision was a NightWing dragonet of unknown gender who was introduced in Darkstalker. They were a seer student of Allknowing and resided in the lost city of night before they fled to the NightWing island.\n\n\n== Biography ==\n\n\n=== Legends ===\n\n\n==== Darkstalker ====\nVision was one of the three students attending Allknowing's class when Clearsight first arrived, along with Morrowwatcher and Jewel-eyes. When Clearsight told them that she found the class by looking into the future, Vision was astonished by her foretelling abilities and revealed to her that most seers could not look for whatever they wanted to, and they had to wait until visions came to them.\n\n\n== Quotes ==\n\n\n== Gallery ==\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\tArt by Jake Parker, from Darkstalker (graphic novel)",
